10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canistilluseevriifistayonebay" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canistilluseevriifistayonebay" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canistilluseevriifistayonebay-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes - you may be assigned to Evri by eBay’s Simple Delivery system or you can choose to exclude Royal Mail. You’ll just need to use the pre-paid label provided through eBay&#39;s platform.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="willistillgettracking-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-willistillgettracking" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-willistillgettracking" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Will I still get tracking?-open answer" data-test-id="willistillgettracking-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="willistillgettracking-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Will I still get tracking?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-willistillgettracking" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-willistillgettracking" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="willistillgettracking-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes - whether you send through eBay or directly with Evri, full parcel tracking is included as standard.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howdoiknowifimeligibleforanebaybusinessselleraccount-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howdoiknowifimeligibleforanebaybusinessselleraccount" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howdoiknowifimeligibleforanebaybusinessselleraccount" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How do I know if I’m eligible for an eBay business seller account?-open answer" data-test-id="howdoiknowifimeligibleforanebaybusinessselleraccount-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howdoiknowifimeligibleforanebaybusinessselleraccount-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How do I know if I’m eligible for an eBay business seller account?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron