4ccdf39b",false,{"link_type":19},[24,37,88,117,154,164,191,200,231,273,348,371,394],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":29,"id":35,"slice_type":36,"slice_label":10},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[28],{},{"theme":10,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderImage":32,"heroImage":33,"videoContent":34,"showPremiumLogo":10},"eBay Simple Delivery",[],{},{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":39,"primary":40,"id":86,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":41,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":53,"CardText":54,"ButtonText":82,"ButtonUrl":83,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":42,"alt":45,"copyright":10,"url":46,"id":47,"edit":48},{"width":43,"height":44},1000,666,"A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen.","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z7b7mJ7c43Q3f_8q",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},0,1,"transparent","none","What it means for you – and how Evri can help",[55,67],{"type":56,"text":57,"spans":58,"direction":66},"paragraph","eBay has made some changes to how delivery works for sellers. From April 15th 2025, a service called Simple Delivery was rolled out across the platform. Whether you run a side hustle or an online business, it’s important to understand how this change might affect you and what choices you have. ",[59,63],{"start":60,"end":61,"type":62},67,82,"strong",{"start":64,"end":65,"type":62},101,117,"ltr",{"type":56,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":66},"If you regularly send lots of parcels, you could save up to 50% on UK shipping and 20% on international shipping as an Evri Frequent Seller. You will also need an eBay business seller account to continue sending through Evri.com, but you can easily upgrade to this from a private eBay seller account.",[70,73,81],{"start":71,"end":72,"type":62},49,63,{"start":74,"end":75,"type":76,"data":77},163,191,"hyperlink",{"link_type":78,"url":79,"target":80},"Web","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.ebay.co.uk\u002Fsellercentre\u002Fselling\u002Fcreate-ebay-business-account","_blank",{"start":74,"end":75,"type":62},"Find out more",{"link_type":78,"key":84,"url":85},"7e812908-4b9b-401e-9bc0-f30aa6057bfd","\u002Ffrequent-seller","card$80b506de-fc22-451e-a9de-4f8680c351a9","card",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":90,"primary":91,"id":115,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":10},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":92,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":10,"label_theme":93,"titleH2":94,"bodyText":95,"image":104,"rightImage":111,"buttonText":10,"buttonLink":112,"buttonDataGtmTrack":10,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":114,"secondary_button_external":21},"standard","Core","What is eBay Simple Delivery?",[96],{"type":56,"text":97,"spans":98,"direction":66},"Simple Delivery is eBay's integrated shipping solution designed to simplify the postage process for private (non-business) sellers. It uses automatic label generation based on the buyer’s location, parcel size, and service level.",[99,101],{"start":49,"end":100,"type":62},15,{"start":102,"end":103,"type":62},140,166,{"dimensions":105,"alt":107,"copyright":10,"url":108,"id":109,"edit":110},{"width":43,"height":106},643,"A close-up bird's eye view of a customer holding their mobile phone shows the Evri website home page on display. Lots of parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZyIqu68jQArT0BYb_small_business.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZyIqu68jQArT0BYb",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},true,{"link_type":113},"Any",{"link_type":113},"landing_feature_banner$91f72178-d4a7-4716-8cc3-e445a01ce66c","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":118,"primary":119,"id":153,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":10},[],{"theme":120,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":10,"label_theme":93,"titleH2":121,"bodyText":122,"image":144,"rightImage":21,"buttonText":10,"buttonLink":151,"buttonDataGtmTrack":10,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":152,"secondary_button_external":21},"neutral","The pros and cons for sellers",[123,129,134,139],{"type":124,"text":125,"spans":126,"direction":66},"list-item","Automatic label generation: eBay assigns a carrier (either Royal Mail or Evri) and provides a prepaid shipping label or QR code once an item is sold",[127],{"start":49,"end":128,"type":62},26,{"type":124,"text":130,"spans":131,"direction":66},"Standardised pricing: Shipping costs are predetermined based on item weight categories set by eBay",[132],{"start":49,"end":133,"type":62},20,{"type":124,"text":135,"spans":136,"direction":66},"​Limited seller options: Sellers can no longer choose specific couriers; they can only exclude services through their eBay account settings",[137],{"start":50,"end":138,"type":62},23,{"type":124,"text":140,"spans":141,"direction":66},"Buyers pay shipping directly to eBay: This means sellers can’t control the price of delivery to make a mark-up or to give cheaper options for buyers",[142],{"start":49,"end":143,"type":62},36,{"dimensions":145,"alt":147,"copyright":10,"url":148,"id":149,"edit":150},{"width":43,"height":146},667,"A mother is placing the lid on a parcel box with the shipping label attached so it is ready to send. Her two children are sat on the sofa behind her reading a book.","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc65bqstJ9-inP_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7587.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zc65bqstJ9-inP",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"link_type":113},{"link_type":113},"landing_feature_banner$58700e88-d4e0-432c-a98c-74d3601f40b9",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":155,"primary":156,"id":162,"slice_type":163,"slice_label":10},[],{"SectionHeader":157,"SectionText":158},"What eBay sellers need to know",[159],{"type":56,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":66},"While Simple Delivery can reduce admin for some private sellers, it also means less flexibility for any preferred services and carriers. Plus, you could miss out on better pricing, the full range of services, and handy time-saving tools available when booking directly on Evri.com.",[],"section_component$3b8bc51f-e403-4c77-84c0-d0f26fdee410","section_component",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":165,"primary":166,"id":190,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},[],{"CardImage":167,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":10,"CardText":173,"ButtonText":10,"ButtonUrl":189,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":168,"alt":169,"copyright":10,"url":170,"id":171,"edit":172},{"width":43,"height":146},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},[174,180,184],{"type":56,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":66},"From April 15, 2025, the following changes have taken effect: ",[177],{"start":178,"end":179,"type":62},5,19,{"type":124,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":66},"Private sellers: Simple Delivery becomes the default and only shipping option for private sellers unless specific criteria are met. ",[183],{"start":49,"end":100,"type":62},{"type":124,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":66},"Business sellers: Registered eBay business sellers can continue to choose their preferred shipping methods and couriers outside of eBay's Simple Delivery system.",[187],{"start":49,"end":188,"type":62},16,{"link_type":113},"card$18309e01-052a-4c25-a3e1-b5c3acb54956",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":192,"primary":193,"id":199,"slice_type":163,"slice_label":10},[],{"SectionHeader":194,"SectionText":195},"What are my options?",[196],{"type":56,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":66},"Depending on how you sell and what you want from your delivery setup, you can choose from one of two paths:",[],"section_component$7e649393-7035-41b1-95d7-4524895898ba",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":201,"primary":202,"id":230,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},[],{"CardImage":203,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":209,"CardText":210,"ButtonText":10,"ButtonUrl":229,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":204,"alt":205,"copyright":10,"url":206,"id":207,"edit":208},{"width":43,"height":146},"A close-up of a customer's hands as they are crouched on the floor, placing folded items a cardboard box.","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5239.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"1. Stay as a private seller and use Simple Delivery",[211,214,217,220,223,226],{"type":56,"text":212,"spans":213,"direction":66},"If you send a few parcels a month, Simple Delivery might be a convenient option for you:",[],{"type":124,"text":215,"spans":216,"direction":66},"You don’t need to set up delivery manually – eBay handles it",[],{"type":124,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":66},"You’ll be assigned a courier automatically (Evri may still be selected!)",[],{"type":124,"text":221,"spans":222,"direction":66},"You won’t be able to choose your own postage pricing or delivery preferences",[],{"type":124,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":66},"You must use the pre-paid labels generated by eBay",[],{"type":56,"text":227,"spans":228,"direction":66},"You can still enjoy reliable service through Evri if assigned to us by eBay - but you’ll need to manage everything through the eBay platform. Simple Delivery also means you won’t access better pricing or collect Tesco Clubcard points.",[],{"link_type":113},"card$1e04cd5f-9442-40f9-8b01-7ee22577a225",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":232,"primary":233,"id":272,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},[],{"CardImage":234,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":240,"CardText":241,"ButtonText":82,"ButtonUrl":270,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":235,"alt":236,"copyright":10,"url":237,"id":238,"edit":239},{"width":43,"height":146},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"2. Apply for an eBay business seller account and ship directly via Evri.com",[242,245,248,251,254,257,260],{"type":56,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":66},"Are you a regular eBay seller who hasn't switched to a business account because of the added fees? You’re not alone. Many sellers are in this “grey area”. But did you know?",[],{"type":124,"text":246,"spans":247,"direction":66},"Becoming a business seller lets you opt out of Simple Delivery",[],{"type":124,"text":249,"spans":250,"direction":66},"You can choose Evri as your delivery provider every time",[],{"type":124,"text":252,"spans":253,"direction":66},"Get access to exclusive discounts and collect Tesco Clubcard points on every order when you use Evri.com directly",[],{"type":124,"text":255,"spans":256,"direction":66},"Use marketplace integrations with eBay, Etsy, Amazon and more to manage all your orders in one place on Bulk Send.",[],{"type":56,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":66},"With an eBay business seller account, you can send directly through Evri.com - giving you flexibility, better value, and more features. Plus, you don’t need to be a registered company to qualify as a business seller on eBay.",[],{"type":56,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":66},"Become a business seller on eBay to access exclusive discounts as an Evri Frequent Seller.",[263,265,269],{"start":49,"end":264,"type":62},32,{"start":266,"end":267,"type":76,"data":268},69,89,{"link_type":78,"url":85,"target":80},{"start":266,"end":267,"type":62},{"link_type":78,"key":271,"url":79},"ff067422-d08a-40e3-a290-0803a4914393","card$5e3bf818-8f9d-426d-9f83-dff36337b5b9",{"variation":274,"version":26,"items":275,"primary":343,"id":346,"slice_type":347,"slice_label":10},"listComponent",[276,295,307,319,331],{"title":277,"content":278,"icon":288},"Big savings on every parcel",[279],{"type":56,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":66},"Enjoy up to 50% off UK deliveries and 20% off international deliveries",[282,285],{"start":283,"end":284,"type":62},12,22,{"start":286,"end":287,"type":62},38,60,{"dimensions":289,"alt":291,"copyright":10,"url":292,"id":293,"edit":294},{"width":290,"height":290},40,"Money icon","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"title":296,"content":297,"icon":301},"Next Day delivery for less",[298],{"type":56,"text":299,"spans":300,"direction":66},"Choose to upgrade to Next Day UK delivery from just 48p, helping you meet tight shipping deadlines without breaking the bank",[],{"dimensions":302,"alt":303,"copyright":10,"url":304,"id":305,"edit":306},{"width":290,"height":290},"Above and beyond icon","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"title":308,"content":309,"icon":313},"Simpler pricing, smarter sending",[310],{"type":56,"text":311,"spans":312,"direction":66},"We’ve made it easier to budget with just three simple weight bands for UK parcels: 0-1kg, 1-5kg, and 5-15kg",[],{"dimensions":314,"alt":315,"copyright":10,"url":316,"id":317,"edit":318},{"width":290,"height":290},"Lightbulb icon","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9028d913-9c89-4f01-b423-3fd1d160c4a1_lightbulb.svg","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zru",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"title":320,"content":321,"icon":325},"Use Bulk Send integrations",[322],{"type":56,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":66},"Link your account with popular marketplaces and ecommerce platforms to book and manage your online orders from one dashboard.",[],{"dimensions":326,"alt":327,"copyright":10,"url":328,"id":329,"edit":330},{"width":290,"height":290},"Laptop icon","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"title":332,"content":333,"icon":337},"Collect Tesco Clubcard points",[334],{"type":56,"text":335,"spans":336,"direction":66},"Start collecting Tesco Clubcard points on every order – now available with your international parcels as well as UK deliveries",[],{"dimensions":338,"alt":339,"copyright":10,"url":340,"id":341,"edit":342},{"width":290,"height":290},"Pricing icon","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},{"theme":92,"title":344,"description":345},"Why choose Evri.com over Simple Delivery?","Here's what you'll get when you sign up for an Evri Frequent Seller Account:","list_block$082323cb-7a9a-42ac-b8c1-b281fbdc2a1e","list_block",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":349,"primary":350,"id":370,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},[],{"CardImage":351,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":357,"CardText":358,"ButtonText":367,"ButtonUrl":368,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":352,"alt":353,"copyright":10,"url":354,"id":355,"edit":356},{"width":43,"height":146},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Become a Frequent Seller",[359,362],{"type":56,"text":360,"spans":361,"direction":66},"If you regularly send lots of parcels, booking directly with Evri.com could save you more and give you greater control. ",[],{"type":56,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":66},"With our dedicated Frequent Seller business account, you'll enjoy exclusive prices, more flexibility, and tools designed to help you scale your business.",[365],{"start":179,"end":366,"type":62},51,"Get started",{"link_type":78,"key":369,"url":85},"061a6928-e4f3-4203-9db9-fa658701bc00","card$532caac3-3301-469a-8f79-79487e2be7f2",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":372,"primary":373,"id":393,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":10},[],{"CardImage":374,"CardAvatar":52,"CardTitle":380,"CardText":381,"ButtonText":82,"ButtonUrl":391,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":375,"alt":376,"copyright":10,"url":377,"id":378,"edit":379},{"width":43,"height":146},"A customer crouched on the floor, applying a label to their parcel. They are surrounded by lots of parcels.","ebay-simple-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsm5bqstJ9-We5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5349.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xsm5bqstJ9-We5",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Smaller business = big savings",[382,385,388],{"type":56,"text":383,"spans":384,"direction":66},"Not quite sending 40 parcels a month? You can still unlock great savings with Evri.",[],{"type":56,"text":386,"spans":387,"direction":66},"Spend just £30 or more on UK or international deliveries and enjoy discounted prices with a special offer just for you – no account upgrade or extra steps required.",[],{"type":56,"text":389,"spans":390,"direction":66},"It’s an easy way for growing businesses and side hustlers to get more value with every order.",[],{"link_type":78,"key":369,"url":392},"\u002Fswitch-to-evri","card$5b993063-5530-4ea1-ba8c-fe6c96c09bcc",{"variation":38,"version":26,"items":395,"primary":425,"id":427,"slice_type":428,"slice_label":10},[396,402,408,414],{"questionTitle":397,"questionBody":398},"What if I don’t want to use Simple Delivery?",[399],{"type":56,"text":400,"spans":401,"direction":66},"Unless you’re registered as a business seller on eBay, you won’t be able to opt out. If you want full control over your shipping options, we recommend applying for a business seller account. ",[],{"questionTitle":403,"questionBody":404},"Can I still use Evri if I stay on eBay?",[405],{"type":56,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":66},"Yes - you may be assigned to Evri by eBay’s Simple Delivery system or you can choose to exclude Royal Mail. You’ll just need to use the pre-paid label provided through eBay's platform.",[],{"questionTitle":409,"questionBody":410},"Will I still get tracking?",[411],{"type":56,"text":412,"spans":413,"direction":66},"Yes - whether you send through eBay or directly with Evri, full parcel tracking is included as standard.",[],{"questionTitle":415,"questionBody":416},"How do I know if I’m eligible for an eBay business seller account?",[417],{"type":56,"text":418,"spans":419,"direction":66},"If you regularly sell items, buy goods to resell, or sell on multiple marketplaces, you likely qualify. Check out eBay's website to find out more.",[420,424],{"start":421,"end":422,"type":76,"data":423},132,145,{"link_type":78,"url":79,"target":80},{"start":421,"end":422,"type":62},{"title":426},"FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$6ee03c6a-d72e-47ff-8b64-f0aa1c140dd2","frequently_asked_questions",[24,37,88,117,154,164,191,200,231,273,348,371,394],["Reactive",431],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":432,"$sclients":498,"$sglobal-basket-count":10},{"abtasty":433,"accessibe":436,"appPromoBanner":439,"autoDivertUpdates":442,"awin":445,"bulkInternational":448,"bulkSendEnabled":451,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":454,"enableBasketCount":457,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":460,"euCustomsDuty":463,"groovyAdvert":466,"newInternationalSendFlow":469,"newinternationalpages":476,"oohPreferenceFlag":480,"opentel":483,"premium":486,"savedCards":489,"smallParcelSize":492,"yourPricesDrawer":495